# Spreadsheets are generated or maintained elsewhere, never tracked. The
# degree-requirements workbooks live in the advising data folder, by hand.
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Excel lock files
~$*

# Transcripts, and anything derived from one. A real transcript is a student
# record and must never enter this history.
*.pdf
output.txt
result.csv

# The one exception: an anonymized sample used as the checks' fixture. Its
# name is "Last, First", its student number 1234567, its date of birth MM/YY.
# See CLAUDE.md before adding any other exception here.
!sample-transcript.pdf

# Scratch directories the checks create for themselves
_*_test/
scratch/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS
.DS_Store
